          "title": "IBM 大型机",
          "content": "<p>1964年，IBM 公司推出 System / 360 大型机，下面是当时的宣传图片。（@<a href=\"https://github.com/ruanyf/weekly/issues/431\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">mcushilei</a> 投稿）</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/201905/bg2019053133.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>整套系统需要占满一间大厅。上图中央的双 H 机柜是 CPU，左侧靠墙和前方的机柜是内存和磁带机，右侧和下部的机柜都是 I/O 设备。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/201905/bg2019053134.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/201905/bg2019053135.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>",
